# snapatac2_qc_generation.py

## Overview
`qc_atac` is a Python script designed to perform quality control (QC) on ATAC-seq data using the SnapATAC2 toolkit.

## Usage
$ pip install --editable .
$ qc_atac [OPTIONS]

Options:
  --fragment_file PATH        Path to the fragment file.  [required]
  --compressed_gtf_file PATH  Path to the compressed GTF file.  [required]
  --chrom_sizes PATH          Path to the chromosome sizes file.  [required]
  --min_frag_cutoff INTEGER   Minimum fragment cutoff. Default is 10.
  --prefix TEXT               Prefix for output files. Default is snap.
  --help                      Show this message and exit.